{"id":"vd-b2-the-promise","level":"b2","n":27,"title":{"en":"You've Got What It Takes","vi":"Anh có đủ bản lĩnh mà"},"summary":"Cây số ba mươi hai, Danny dừng lại bên rào chắn và muốn bỏ cuộc; bà Bea và cậu bé Jamie động viên anh đi tiếp, từng cột đèn một.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b2-the-promise","level":"b2","title":{"en":"The Promise","vi":"Lời hứa"}},"scene":{"background":"street","props":[]},"cast":{"danny":{"name":{"en":"Danny","vi":"Danny"},"look":"dad","x":300,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#6E4B2A","outfit":"tee","top":"#2E86C1","topShade":"#2874A6"}},"bea":{"name":{"en":"Bea","vi":"Bea"},"look":"grandma","x":820,"style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#E74C3C","topShade":"#CB4335"}},"jamie":{"name":{"en":"Jamie","vi":"Jamie"},"look":"boy","x":1260,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#6E4B2A","outfit":"tee","top":"#F4D03F","topShade":"#D4AC0D"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"danny","en":"I can't do it, Bea. My knee's gone, and I'm utterly exhausted. I think I have to stop.","vi":"Tôi không làm nổi đâu, Bea. Đầu gối tôi hỏng rồi, và tôi kiệt sức hoàn toàn. Chắc tôi phải dừng thôi.","ipa":["aɪ","kænt","du","ɪt","bi","maɪ","niz","ɡɔn","ənd","aɪm","ˈʌtɚli","ɪɡˈzɔstɪd","aɪ","θɪŋk","aɪ","hæv","tu","stɑp"],"start":0.554,"end":7.424,"expression":"tired","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.647],[2,1.012],[3,1.207],[4,1.559],[5,2.811],[6,3.006],[7,3.293],[8,3.827],[9,3.983],[10,4.126],[11,4.53],[12,6.144],[13,6.248],[14,6.522],[15,6.626],[16,6.847],[17,6.978]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"Danny, look at me. You've got what it takes. You've just run thirty-two kilometers!","vi":"Danny, nhìn tôi này. Anh có đủ bản lĩnh mà. Anh vừa chạy ba mươi hai cây số đấy!","ipa":["ˈdæni","lʊk","æt","mi","juv","ɡɑt","wʌt","ɪt","teɪks","juv","dʒʌst","ɹʌn","ˈθɝˌdi-tu","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz"],"start":8.214,"end":14.134,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,8.214],[1,8.751],[2,8.919],[3,9.027],[4,10.155],[5,10.372],[6,10.6],[7,10.732],[8,10.84],[9,12.223],[10,12.451],[11,12.715],[12,12.956],[13,13.437]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"And there are ten more. I can hardly walk.","vi":"Mà còn mười cây số nữa. Tôi gần như không đi nổi.","ipa":["ənd","ðɛɹ","ɑɹ","tɛn","mɔɹ","aɪ","kæn","ˈhɑɹdli","wɔk"],"start":14.924,"end":18.244,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,14.924],[1,15.057],[2,15.266],[3,15.37],[4,15.643],[5,17.026],[6,17.221],[7,17.39],[8,17.833]]},{"speaker":"jamie","en":"Uncle Danny! Keep going! You're nearly there!","vi":"Bác Danny ơi! Cố lên! Sắp tới rồi!","ipa":["ˈʌŋkəl","ˈdæni","kip","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","jʊɹ","ˈnɪɹli","ðɛɹ"],"start":19.034,"end":23.584,"gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,19.034],[1,19.389],[2,20.777],[3,21.089],[4,22.451],[5,22.727],[6,23.214]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"Think how far you've come. Ten months ago, you couldn't run for five minutes.","vi":"Nghĩ xem anh đã đi được bao xa. Mười tháng trước, anh không chạy nổi năm phút.","ipa":["θɪŋk","haʊ","fɑɹ","juv","kʌm","tɛn","mʌnθs","əˈɡoʊ","ju","ˈkʊdənt","ɹʌn","fɔɹ","faɪv","ˈmɪnəts"],"start":24.374,"end":28.924,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,24.374],[1,24.522],[2,24.691],[3,24.895],[4,25.063],[5,26.287],[6,26.54],[7,26.828],[8,27.357],[9,27.465],[10,27.754],[11,27.982],[12,28.138],[13,28.427]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"I know, but this is different. Every step hurts.","vi":"Tôi biết, nhưng lần này khác. Bước nào cũng đau.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","bʌt","ðɪs","ɪz","ˈdɪfɚənt","ˈɛvɚi","stɛp","hɝts"],"start":29.714,"end":33.414,"expression":"tired","timing":[[0,29.714],[1,29.771],[2,30.292],[3,30.488],[4,30.696],[5,30.839],[6,32.234],[7,32.612],[8,32.938]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"Then don't think about ten kilometers. Forget your nerves and just get to the next lamp post.","vi":"Vậy đừng nghĩ đến mười cây số. Quên nỗi lo đi và cứ chạy đến cột đèn tiếp theo thôi.","ipa":["ðɛn","doʊnt","θɪŋk","əˈbaʊt","tɛn","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz","fɚˈɡɛt","jɔɹ","nɝvz","ənd","dʒʌst","ɡɛt","tu","ðə","nɛkst","læmp","poʊst"],"start":34.204,"end":39.794,"gesture":"point","timing":[[0,34.204],[1,34.418],[2,34.671],[3,34.875],[4,35.176],[5,35.416],[6,36.977],[7,37.397],[8,37.518],[9,37.902],[10,38.094],[11,38.347],[12,38.527],[13,38.611],[14,38.719],[15,39.056],[16,39.32]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"The next lamp post?","vi":"Cột đèn tiếp theo ư?","ipa":["ðə","nɛkst","læmp","poʊst"],"start":40.584,"end":41.724,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,40.584],[1,40.632],[2,40.997],[3,41.27]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"Exactly. Then the next one. Walk if you need to. There's no shame in walking.","vi":"Chính xác. Rồi đến cột tiếp theo. Cần thì cứ đi bộ. Đi bộ chẳng có gì đáng xấu hổ.","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæktli","ðɛn","ðə","nɛkst","wʌn","wɔk","ɪf","ju","nid","tu","ðɛɹz","noʊ","ʃeɪm","ɪn","ˈwɔkɪŋ"],"start":42.514,"end":49.354,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,42.514],[1,44.111],[2,44.375],[3,44.459],[4,44.808],[5,45.95],[6,46.286],[7,46.407],[8,46.527],[9,46.743],[10,47.909],[11,48.185],[12,48.39],[13,48.738],[14,48.846]]},{"speaker":"jamie","en":"I believe in you! Dad always said you were tougher than you looked.","vi":"Cháu tin bác! Bố cháu luôn nói bác cứng cỏi hơn vẻ ngoài nhiều.","ipa":["aɪ","bɪˈliv","ɪn","ju","dæd","ˈɔlˌweɪz","sɛd","ju","wɝ","ˈtʌfɚ","ðæn","ju","lʊkt"],"start":50.144,"end":54.894,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,50.144],[1,50.262],[2,50.724],[3,50.887],[4,52.099],[5,52.524],[6,52.999],[7,53.274],[8,53.424],[9,53.574],[10,54.062],[11,54.249],[12,54.437]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"Did he really say that?","vi":"Bố cháu thực sự nói vậy à?","ipa":["dɪd","hi","ˈɹɪli","seɪ","ðæt"],"start":55.684,"end":56.954,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,55.684],[1,55.804],[2,55.987],[3,56.338],[4,56.586]]},{"speaker":"jamie","en":"All the time. Usually when you were eating cake.","vi":"Suốt ạ. Thường là lúc bác đang ăn bánh.","ipa":["ɔl","ðə","taɪm","ˈjuʒəwəli","wɛn","ju","wɝ","ˈitɪŋ","keɪk"],"start":57.744,"end":61.284,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,57.744],[1,57.962],[2,58.111],[3,59.449],[4,60.099],[5,60.311],[6,60.462],[7,60.624],[8,61.011]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"That sounds like him. He was genuinely funny.","vi":"Đúng là kiểu của nó. Nó thực sự rất hài hước.","ipa":["ðæt","saʊndz","laɪk","hɪm","hi","wɑz","ˈdʒɛnjəwənli","ˈfʌni"],"start":62.074,"end":65.594,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,62.074],[1,62.273],[2,62.676],[3,62.924],[4,64.072],[5,64.267],[6,64.488],[7,65.152]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"Don't give up now, Danny. You've already done the hardest part.","vi":"Đừng bỏ cuộc lúc này, Danny. Anh đã vượt qua phần khó nhất rồi.","ipa":["doʊnt","ɡɪv","ʌp","naʊ","ˈdæni","juv","ɔlˈɹɛdi","dʌn","ðə","ˈhɑɹdəst","pɑɹt"],"start":66.384,"end":70.434,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,66.384],[1,66.635],[2,66.827],[3,66.983],[4,67.464],[5,68.76],[6,68.976],[7,69.337],[8,69.565],[9,69.637],[10,70.07]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"All right. Just to the next lamp post.","vi":"Được rồi. Chỉ đến cột đèn tiếp theo thôi.","ipa":["ɔl","ɹaɪt","dʒʌst","tu","ðə","nɛkst","læmp","poʊst"],"start":71.224,"end":74.434,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,71.224],[1,71.433],[2,72.789],[3,73.127],[4,73.245],[5,73.362],[6,73.7],[7,73.974]]},{"speaker":"bea","en":"That's it! You can do this. We'll see you at the finish.","vi":"Đúng rồi! Anh làm được mà. Chúng tôi sẽ đợi anh ở vạch đích.","ipa":["ðæts","ɪt","ju","kæn","du","ðɪs","wil","si","ju","æt","ðə","ˈfɪnɪʃ"],"start":75.224,"end":79.634,"gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,75.224],[1,75.475],[2,76.675],[3,76.867],[4,77.035],[5,77.227],[6,78.465],[7,78.67],[8,78.838],[9,78.97],[10,79.066],[11,79.163]]},{"speaker":"jamie","en":"Go, Uncle Danny! Do it for Dad!","vi":"Cố lên bác Danny! Vì bố cháu nhé!","ipa":["ɡoʊ","ˈʌŋkəl","ˈdæni","du","ɪt","fɔɹ","dæd"],"start":80.424,"end":83.734,"gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,80.424],[1,80.892],[2,81.291],[3,82.679],[4,82.916],[5,83.092],[6,83.329]]},{"speaker":"danny","en":"For Kevin. Here we go.","vi":"Vì Kevin. Đi nào.","ipa":["fɔɹ","ˈkɛvɪn","hiɹ","wi","ɡoʊ"],"start":84.524,"end":87.034,"expression":"happy","react":{"bea":"happy"},"timing":[[0,84.524],[1,84.766],[2,86.2],[3,86.5],[4,86.656]]}],"words":[{"id":"shame","en":"shame","ipa":"ʃeɪm","vi":